śrīmahārahasyasaṃpradāyaḥ

(1a)
1 oṃ namo mahābhairavāya ।।

yā sūkṣmādicatuṣkapaṃcakavṛtājñānāvabodhānvitau ।
ṣaṭkenāpi ca*ṣkapaṃcakacatuścāvṛttiviśvaṃ sthitā ।
ājñānaṃdamahāprabodhajananīśrīraudrīṃ namāmyaṃbikāḥ ।।

catuṣkaṃ paṃcakaṃ ṣaṭkaṃ catuṣkaṃ paṃcakaṃ catuḥ ।
ādau pīṭhacatuṣkaṃ tu catvāro pīṭhadevatā ।।

yoginīpaṃcakaṃ caiva jñānaṣaṭkastu meva ca ।
ratnapaṃcakasaṃyuktaṃ siddhacatvāri pūjayet ।।

kulāṣṭakasamāyuktaṃ ṣa(jvavyā) tu samanvitam ।
navaṣoḍaśakaṃ yacca samagraṃ tatra pūjayet ।।
(1b)
gurumaṇḍaṃlavinirmuktaṃ yojayeṃtsatataṃ kramaṃ ।
tatsarvvanisphalaṃ tasya kramabhraṣṭopi jāyate ।।

pūjaye tu mahādeva kramayuktividhānataḥ ।
gurumaṇḍalapṛṣṭhe tu kramamaṇḍalapūjayet ।।

aĩ hrī̃ śrī̃ shkhphrẽ shūṃ bhagavati ambe vajrāsanāya jīvaṃ rakṣarakṣa hreṃ phaṭ svāhā ।।  iti jīvarakṣāsanaṃ ।।
aiṃ 5 kaulakālī vidmahe mahāmālinī dhīmahe tanno kubji pracodayāt ।। etadgāyatrī ।। aĩ 4 bhū namaḥ ।
aĩ 4 hrīṃ bhuvarnamaḥ । aĩ 4 śrīṃ svavarnamaḥ । tato ṣaḍaṅganyāsaṃ kārayet ।
(2a)
mūlavidyāyāṃ vaktrasahitaṃ । atīśikhābaṃdhaṃ kārayet ।।
shkṣmlvryū̃ hrī̃ phaṭ bhairavīmūrttiśikhābandhaṃ kārayet ।।

aĩ dikcarībhyo namaḥ । hrīṃ bhūcarībhyo namaḥ । śrīṃ gocarībhyo namaḥ । hreṃ khecarībhyo namaḥ । shūṃ vyomacarī namaḥ ।
aĩ 4 ākāśagāminībhyo namaḥ । aĩ 5 pātālagāminībhyo namaḥ । aĩ 4 aṃtarikṣavāsinībhyo namaḥ ।
(2b)
tato mūlavidyāyāṃ smarttavyā । anāhatapadmābhyaṃtare pretārūḍho raktavarṇṇādvādaśabhujasaṃyuktā
ṣaṭvaktrādviṃraṣṭavarṣāmaṃtrasarvadāṃ dhyāyet । kūrmamudrāṃ baṃdhayet । janmasthānāyāṃ biṃdusthānaṃ yāvatsaṃmuccārayet ।
tataḥ bhūtatarppaṇaṃ kārayet । hūṃ juṃ saḥ pṛthivībhūtaṃ me tarpaya tarpaya svāhā ।।
hūṃ juṃ saḥ । āpabhūtaṃ me tarpaya tarpaya svāhā ।। hūṃ juṃ saḥ tejabhūtaṃ me tarpaya tarpaya svāhā ।।
hūṃ juṃ saḥ vāyubhūtaṃ me tarpaya tarpaya svāhā ।।
hūṃ juṃ saḥ ākāśabhūtaṃ me tarpaya tarpaya svāhā ।। tato devyāsamayavidyā smarttavyā । tato pitṛtarpaṇaṃ kārayet ।।
(3a)
hūṃ juṃ saḥ pitā - - - - ddhaprapi(tāmahāya hū̃ jũ saḥ) (mātā)ya mātāmahāya vṛddhamātāmahāya hū̃ jũ saḥ tṛ(ptāvatu)
- - - - - - - - - (yātatvasā)naidhyaṃ gurumaṇḍale । gāyatrī sarvama - - - - - - - - (namaḥ । ataḥ arcana)vidhisamārabhya
dakṣahastamadhasthāya - - - - (bhyo pari)sthi - - - - - - (yuktaṃ) maṇḍalaṃ dravyasaṃyutaṃ ।
(3b)
tṛkoṇaṃ mekhalā(trīṇi caturasrabhuvaṃ sthū)laṃ kāraye(t । sūtraṃ nirvaṇaṃ) śubhaṃ muṇḍaratnakarastṛdhā gurūṇāṃ bhrāmayet pūrvvagurūṇāṃ
bhedayet pūrvva(gurūṇā) sthāpaye cātra guru(ye) ko hi paṃcadhā ।
aĩ 5 lã śrīkaṇṭhāya pūrvve । aĩ 5 vã śaṃkarāya dakṣiṇe । aĩ 5 (śã) anaṃtāya (paścime) । aĩ 5 (ṣaṃ sādā)khyāya uttare ।
aĩ 5 haṃ piṅgalāya madhye । aiśāna (vāyavye) - - । aĩ mā(rjārai) vahnimaṇḍala hrīṃ ānaṃdaṃ naiṛtyakoṇe śrīṃ khecarī
vā(mamaṇḍalasthe aṃgu)ṣṭhāgre nya(sedbī)jaṃ śrīnāthabhairavasaha shū̃ । anaṃtaragaṇeśavaṭukasthānaṃ (kṣatradhā sphreṃ) laṃ prapūjayet ।।
(4a)
aĩ - (glū̃) gaṇeśanāthavallabhā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।। dakṣiṇe ।। aĩ 5 (blā̃ blū̃ vaṭu)kanāthavallabhā avvā saha
pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । vāme । paścime aĩ 5 kṣā̃ kṣī̃ shphreṃ sthānakṣetrapālavallabhā avvā pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । ato paṃcapraṇavena
karanyāsaṃ kārayetṛdhā । aĩ vāmakarapṛṣṭhe hrīṃ dakṣiṇakarapṛṣṭe śrīṃ vāmakaratale shphreṃ dakṣakaratale shū̃ vāmakarapṛṣṭhe anena
krameṇa karaśodhayatṛdhā । tṛprakārayuktena tato astraṃ bhrāmayet । ṣaḍaṃgayuktyā rakṣaṇārthena aĩ 5 shā̃ amṛtodbhavahṛdayāya namaḥ ।
shī̃ amṛtatejomālinītṛptisirase svāhā ।
(4b)
aĩ 5 shũ (vadhave) dhanī anādisvachaṃdaśikhāyai vauṣaṭ । shaiṃ vajriṇi vajraghorāya svataṃtrabodhyakavacāya hūṃ । aĩ 5 shauṃ
(a)luptaṃśaktinetratrayāya vaṣaṭ ।
aĩ 5 shaḥ anaṃtaśakti phreṃ rakṣa rakṣa astrāya phaṭ । ato arghapātrasthāpanavidhiḥ ।। ।।
paṃcapraṇavayuktena āsanaṃ kārayet । pūrvve aĩ । dakṣiṇe hrīṃ । paścime śrī̃ । uttare shphrẽ । madhye shūṃ । etatpṛṣṭhe arghapātraṃ
sthāpya pūjayet । alisaṃpūrṇṇaṃ kārayet ।
(5a)
punarapi paṃcapraṇavaṃ anena krameṇa nyastavyaṃ arghapātrābhyantare puṣpapaṃcakaṃ datvā astreṇa sādhayenmatraṃ kavacenāvaguṇṭhayet ।
mūlena vinyaset madhye pūjayedarcayetsudhī ।

āgacchaṃtu svayaṃ maṃtrā tīrthakoṭisvalaṃkṛtā ।
pūjayeda(rgha)puṣpena mūlavidyāstu tejasā ।।

aĩ 5 bhagavati ambe hsphreṃ shphrī̃ kubjike shroṃ shrīṃ shrauṃ aghoreśvarī aghorāmukhe chāṃ chīṃ kiṇi kiṇi vicce hsūṃ 5 ।।
tato karanyāsaṃ aṃgavaktrai saha kārayet ।।

(5b)
aĩ hrī̃ śrī̃ hsphrẽ (hsvaṃ) bhagavati aṃbe aṃ aṃ aṃguṣṭhāya śrīādināthapādukebhyo namaḥ । hsphrẽ shphrẽ kubjike taṃ taṃ tarjanyāyai
śrītejasānaṃdanāthapādukebhyo namaḥ । shrā̃ shrī̃ shrauṃ maṃ maṃ madhyamāya śrīmadananāthapādukebhyo namaḥ । aghoreśvarī aghorāmukhe aṃ aṃ
anāmikāyai śrīanāmayanāthapādukebhyo namaḥ । chāṃ chīṃ kiṇi kiṇi vicce kaṃ kaṃ kaniṣṭhāya śrīkapolanāthapādukebhyo namaḥ ।।
hskṣmlvryū̃ shkṣmlvryū̃ śrīkaulīśanāthaśrīkubjikā avvā karatalapṛṣṭhapādukebhyo namaḥ ।।
(6a)
hrīṃ vaṃ vaṃ vāme maṇibaṃdhasthāne (mā)yāyai pādukebhyo namaḥ । daṃ daṃ dakṣiṇamaṇibaṃdhasthāne mahāmāyāyai pādukebhyo namaḥ । chāṃ chīṃ kiṇi
kiṇi vicce anakvanāthakarasphālāya phaṭ । aĩ hrī̃ śrī̃ shrū̃ shū̃ bhagavati ambe parādevīśivāya (ūrddhava)ktrāya śrīśivanāthapādukebhyo namaḥ ।
hsphreṃ shphreṃ kubjike pūrvvavaktrāya śrīvyomanāthapādukebhyo namaḥ । shrā̃ shrīṃ shraũ siddhayogeśvarīmudrāyai pūrvvavaktrāya śrīvyāpakanāthapādukebhyo
namaḥ । aghoreśvarī aghorāmukhakālikāyai dakṣiṇavaktrāya śrījyotināthapādukebhyo namaḥ ।
(6b)
chā̃ chī̃ kiṇi mahaṃtārikāyai mahālakṣmī uttaravaktrāya śrīśaktināthapādukebhyo namaḥ । kiṇi vicce kubjikā avvā ājñāya paścimavaktrāya
śrībiṃdunāthapādukebhyo namaḥ ।। etadvaktraṃ ।।
aĩ bhagavati ambe hṛtkamalāyai śrīhṛdayodayanāthapādukebhyo hṛdayāya namaḥ । hsphreṃ shphreṃ kubjikeśikhaṇḍanāthapādukebhyo śirase svāhā ।
shrā̃ shrī̃ shraũ varvvaraśikhe - śilāśekharanāthaśikhāya vauṣaṭ । aghoreśvarī aghorāmukhe caṇḍanāthapādukebhyo kavacāya hūṃ । chāṃ chīṃ kiṇi
(7a)
mahāntārikāyai mahālakṣmī śrījyotināthapādukebhyo (ne)tratrayāya vaṣaṭ । kiṇi vicce kubjikā avvā ājñāyai śrīanaṅganāthapādukebhyo
astrāya phaṭ । eta(tṣa)ḍaṃgaṃ । aĩ bhagāya namaḥ guhye । hrīṃ māyāyai namaḥ nābhau । śrīṃ lakṣmyāye namaḥ hṛdaye । shphrẽ raudrāyai namaḥ vaktre ।
hsūaũ parātmāya namaḥ bhrūmadhye । aĩ vāmanāsāpuṭe । hrīṃ dakṣanāsāpuṭe । śrīṃ vāmacakṣu । hsphreṃ dakṣacakṣu । (shū̃) bhrūdaṇḍadvayamadhye । aĩ lalāṭe ।
hrīṃ dakṣakarṇṇe । śrī̃ vāmakarṇṇe । hsphreṃ kṛkoṭikāyāṃ hsūaũ mastakopari । etanmūrttikośanyāsaḥ ।
(7b)
tato dravyasaṃskāraṃ kārayet । shaũ saṃjīvani saṃjīvani puṣpānāṃ hrīṃ paramanādinī dhūpe । śrīṃ paramāmṛtāyai caṃdano hrīṃ anantabalaparākramāyai arghe ।
hsphreṃ jyotirūpātmane jyotiśu dīpe ।।
etaddravyasaṃskāraarghapātreṇa prokṣayet । tato arghapātrābhya(ntare ratna)paṃcakam viṣayai saha pūjayetkārayet । glūṃ brahmaratnaśrotraṃbhūta
śravaṇaviṣayā(naṃdanā)thapādukāṃ pūjayāmi । slū̃ viṣṇuratnatvagbhūtasparśaviṣayānandanāthapādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।
(8a)
plū̃ ru(paratna)cakṣubhūtadraṣṭaviṣayānaṃdanāthapādukāṃ pūjayāmi । mlū̃ īśvararatnajihvābhūtaāśvā(daviṣayā)naṃdanāthapādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।
nlū̃ sadāśivaratnaghrāṇabhūtagandhaviṣayānaṃdanāthapādukāṃ pūjayāmi । tatorghapātrāsvaśarīraṃ sparśayet ।

brahmāṇḍakhaṇḍasaṃbhūtaṃ aśeṣarasasaṃbhavaṃ ।
āpūritaṃ mahāpātraṃ peyūṣaṃ cārghamānayet ।।

sahakṣamalavarayū̃ । hasakṣamalavarayū̃ śrīānaṃdabhairavāya vauṣaṭ । surādevī amṛtaṃ śrava śrava svāhā ।
(8b)
pātre nītiṃ kṛte paścāt yāvat parikalpayet ।
bhūrisūryapratīkāśaṃ caṃdrakoṭisamaprabhaṃ ।।

tanmadhye ciṃtayedbiṃdutṛkoṇaṃ vahnimaṇḍalaṃ ।
taḍidbhūrimahātejaṃ śravaṃtaṃ amṛtaṃ paraṃ ।।

tenāmṛtena tatpātraṃ pūryamāṇaṃ viciṃtayet ।
tanmadhye bhāvayeddevīṃ padmarāgasamaprabhāṃ ।।

tataḥ sama(graguruma)ṇḍalaṃ āhvānayet ।।

aĩ hrīṃ śrīṃ shphreṃ shūṃ śrīkaṇṭhāya vidmahe mahāsiddhe dhīma(he tanno) kauli pracodayāt । aĩ brahmāsanapādān । aĩ {5}
(9a)
viṣṇvāsanapādāṃ । aĩ 5 rudrāsa(na)pādāṃ । aĩ 5 iśvarāsa(na)pādāṃ । aĩ 5 sadāśivāsanapādāṃ । aĩ 5 siṃhāsanapādāṃ ।
hskhaphrẽ shkhphrẽ ṣaṭkaāsanaṃ datvā de(vyāṃ ta)tra niveśayet ।।

āsanena vinā deva na tu pūjyāruho bhavet ।

ā̃ ū̃ āgaccha āgaccha śrīkubjikādevī saparivārāṃ āhvānayāmi yā sā parāparāśakti khagasthākhasvarūpiṇīṃ ।
somasūryapadyāṃtasthā āyāhi mama maṇḍale ।।
aĩ hrī̃ śrī̃ hskhphrẽ shū̃ bhagavati ambe hskhphreṃ shkhphreṃ kubjike shrā̃ shrī̃ shraũ aghoreśvarī aghorāmukhe । -
(9b)
chāṃ chīṃ kiṇi kiṇi vicce shū̃ shkhphrẽ śrī̃ hrī̃ aĩ madhyeṃ pūjyā tataḥ । śāṃbhavatṛkaṃ mekhalāyāṃ pūjayet ।
shrū̃ śrīvastunāthādhikāre hrī̃ kulakaulīsiddhājñā hskhphrẽ manonmanī kubjikājñā valī avvā shkṣmlvryūṃ
śrīsaṃdhyānaṃdadevaśrītṛṣṇīśanāthaśrīnāthapādukāṃ pūjayāmi । shrū̃ śrīmerunāthādhikāre khphreṃ mahākālīkulājñā
manonmanī vakradevī ājñāvalī a(vvā) (sa)hakṣamalavarayū̃ śrīśrīnāthakaulīśabhairavaśrīkubjikā avvā saha
pādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।
(10a)
shrūṃ śrīātmatatvādhikāre kālakālī guruājñā khphrẽ unmanī kubjikājñā valī avvā shkṣmlvryū̃ śrīciṃ(ciṇī)nātha
uḍīśanātha śrīśrīnāthapādukāṃ pūjayāmi । etat sāmbhavatṛkaṃ ।।
khphrẽ mahācaṇḍagogeśvarīśrīudyāne mahāmudrāpīṭhauḍīśanātha oḍā avvā ādhārīśadeva(raktā)devī śakhamaṭhakadambavṛkṣaveṇī
iṃdravāruṇīkhecarīmudrākadaṃbaguhākaravīraśmaśānasiṃhavaṭuka
agnimukhakṣetrapālakṛtayugakhageṃdranāthavijjā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।
(10b)
aĩ 5 khã rsrī̃ śrījālāṃdharamahāmaṇḍapīṭhajālīśanāthajālā avvā ādhāracakrīśadevamahākālī devī jyotimaṭhabilvavṛkṣavilī
devadāyākuraṅgiṇī mudrānirvvāṇa guhā । laṃguḍa । smaśānakapilavaṭukajayaṃtīkṣetrapālatretāyugakūrmanāthamaṅgalaavvā saha pādukāṃ
pūjayāmi । dakṣiṇe ।।
(11a)
aĩ 5 gaṃ plūṃ śrīpūrṇṇagirimahāmaṃtrapīṭhapūrṇṇīśanāthapūrṇṇā avvā kuraṃgīśadeva cāmuṇḍādevī yakṣiṇīmaṭhaciṃcinī vṛkṣavallīcakrāṃkitā
lelihānamudrā śivaguhā dīpaśmaśānapiṅgalavaṭukapātavakarṇṇakṣetrapāladvāparayuge meṣanāthakāmamaṅgalā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।
vāme । aĩ 5 phrẽ caṇḍikāpālinī svāhā ।।
ghaṃ śrīkāmarūmahāpīṭhakāmāśanāthakāmā avvā madeṃdreśadevamahaukṣmādevī anāmayamaṭhakaṭāhavṛkṣavellīaparājitā jagadyonimudrāmanodbhavā
guhā । bhayāpahaśmaśānakṛśodaravaṭukagajakuṃbhakṣetrapālakaliyuge maccheṃdranāthakuṃkaṇā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । agre ।
(11b)
etatpīṭhacatuṣkaṃ tato gurupaṃktiāsanaṃ pūjayet ।। aĩ 5 hskhphrẽ ātmatatvāya shrāṃ vidyātatvāya hsphrẽ śivatatvāya pādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।
aĩ 5 śrīcandraga(rbhā) - danāthabhāgī avvā bhālā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । aĩ 5 śrī̃ muktānaṃdadevamahaṇā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।
aĩ 5 śrīsahajakhecaralalitānaṃdadevacaṃdrā avvā gaṃgā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । aĩ 5 śrīsomānaṃdadeva ānaṃdadevī avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।
(12a)
aĩ 5 śrīlīlānaṃdadeva udayādevī avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । aĩ 5 śrīnāgānaṃdadeva salādeṃvī avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।
aĩ 5 śrīśaktyānaṃdadeva ātmaśa(kti) icchāśakti saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।। iti ātmaṣaṣṭaṃ saha pūjayet । kramāgre ātmaśiropari pūjaye(t) ।
tato mūlavidyāṃ madhye pūjyā dvātriṃśadakṣarā ato ratnapaṃcakaṃ tu kramapūjyā । aĩ 5 u brahmadeva hskhphrẽ manonmanāya glūṃ gaganāmṛtaratnagarbhabhoga
(12b)
vāsinī catuṣaṣṭilakṣasaha(sra)koṭiyoginī vijjā avvā pādagūḍhaguhyagaṃbhīraviśvakṣārapārthivādāravṛhadbrahmane pādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।
aĩ 5 (caṃ) (viṣṇu)deva hskhphrẽ vyāpinyāyai slūṃ svargāmṛtaratnagarbhabhogavāsinī dvātriṃśasahasrala(kṣakoṭi)yoginī svāminī
nipunā avvā pādaśivāṃbutoyarasasītala apavāruṇavyāptiśrī । viṣṇudevapādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।
(13a)
aĩ 5 chaṃ śrīrudradeva hskhphrẽ sama - - plūṃ pavanāmṛtaṃ ratnagarbhabhogavāsinīdevyā ṣoḍaśasahasralakṣakoṭiyoginī svāminī
śrīvidyutmālā avvā pādarajaraktojvalajvālitaśrīrudradevapādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।
aĩ 5 jaṃ śrīīśvaradeva (hskhphrẽ) avyaktāya slūṃ martyāmṛtaratnagarbhabhogavāsinīdevyā aṣṭalakṣasahasrakoṭiyoginī
svāni(jībha)raṇodbhava avvā pādanālājyānalasphījavāyuprāṇarūpeśvarapādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।
oṃ 5 jhaṃ sadāśivadeva hskhphreṃ nādinyāya nlūṃ nāgāmṛtaratnagarbhabhogavāsinī caturlakṣasahasrakoṭiyoginī svāminī khiṃkhinī avvā
pādanabhanirāvaraṇaūrddhvacakrasadāśivāṃtapādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।।
(13b)
iti ratnapaṃcakaṃ pūjayet ।। hsphrā̃ saṃjīvani saṃjīvani sarvajñatā hṛdayāya namaḥ । hsphrīṃ ūrddhakeśe parāpare sirase svāhā
hsphrū̃ prajvalitaśikhe nādinī śi(khāye) vauṣaṭ । hsphrẽ vidyujjihve aghoreśvarīkavacāya hūṃ hsphraũ tārakākṣe mahādīpte
dīptatare netratrayāya vaṣaṭ । hsphraḥ māraṇiṃ māraṇi ā(jñā) śive astrāya phaṭ । hsaphraṃ saṃjīvani
(14a)
saṃjīvani sarvvajñatā ūrddhavaktrāya namaḥ । hsphrīṃ ūrddhakeśeparūpara (pūrvva)vaktrāya namaḥ । hsphrũ prajvalitaśikhaśikhinādinī
dakṣiṇavaktrāya namaḥ । hsphrẽ vidyujji (hve aghoreśvara)uttaravaktrāya namaḥ । hsphrauṃ tārakākṣe mahādīptatarepa(ścima)vaktrā(ya namaḥ) ।
(hsphraṃ māraṇi ā)jñāśive parāparavaktrāya namaḥ । etadaṅgavaktraṃ kārayet । (aĩ 5) - mūlavidyā madhye pūjyā ।।
aĩ hrīṃ śrīṃ hshrīṃ hshrūṃ bhagavati ambe hskhphreṃ shkhphreṃ kubjike (hsrāṃ hsrīṃ hsrauṃ) aghoreśvari aghorāmukhe chāṃ chīṃ kiṇi kiṇi
(14b)
vicce hsvrūṃ hskhphrī̃ śrī̃ hrīṃ aĩ etatsa(mayā)devī dvātriṃśadakṣarā paṃcapraṇavasaṃpuṭayuktā madhye pūjayet । tato mudrātṛtayaṃ baṃdhayet ।
tṛ - - padmamudrā yonimudrā tato navātmāmaṇḍale pūjayet । aĩ 5 uttare vinyaset - - sabhāvānaṃdanāthabrahmāṇī avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।
aĩ 5 (saya) i(śānama)ṇḍalaṃ । halakulīśānaṃdanāthamāheśvarī avvā saha pādukā pūjaya - । aĩ 5 naiṛtye vinyasetkūṭāṃkṣasaṃvarttānaṃdanāthavaiṣṇavī
(15a)
avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । aĩ 5 viṃ - - kraṃ tu dakṣi(ṇe) ma mahākālānaṃdanātha vārāhī avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।
aĩ 5 pūrvve puraṃdaraṃ devaṃ - - - nyā(kyānaṃda)nātha iṃdrāṇī avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । aĩ 5 varuṇāṃ paścime - - - va
kha(ḍgī)śānaṃdanāthacāmuṇḍā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । aĩ 5 vahni(koṇe) - - sedagnirabhujaṃgānaṃdanāthakaumārī avvā
saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । aĩ 5 vāyukoṇe calaṃ nyaset ।
(15b)
5(pravā)lyānaṃdanāthamahālakṣmī avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । aĩ  bhagavati ambe hsphrẽ shphrẽ kubjike hsrā̃ hsrī̃ hsraũ
aghoreśvarī aghorāmukhe chāṃ chīṃ kiṇi kiṇi vicce hsphrū̃ 5 ū̃ naukeśvaranāthaku(bji)kā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।
madhye । shkṣmlvryū̃ tato yonimudrāṃ (baṃdhaye)t । tataḥ ṣoḍaśānāṃ nāthānāṃ ājñāmutpannā pūjayet । hskhphrẽ śrīcaṃdra(pu)ranātha(śrīcaṃdra)prabhā
avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । paścime । hskhphrẽ śrīṃ (gulma)nātha śrī(gaha)naprabhā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । uttare । hskhphrẽ
(16a)
śrīstambhanāthaśrīsthūla(prabhā) avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । pūrvve । hasakhaphrẽ śrīkarpāśānaṃdanāthaśrīkamalāprabhā avvā saha (pādukāṃ)
pūjayā(mi) । hskhphrẽ śrīvaṭapuranātha vaṭaprabhā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । aiśā(nye) । hskhphrẽ śrī(vira)janātha śrīvīraprabhā avvā
saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । naiṛtye । hsphrẽ śrīprayāsanātha śrī(paṃca)prabhā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।
āgnaye । hsphreṃ śrīkaṃśālānaṃdanātha śrīkaṃlālaprabhā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।
(16b)
vāyavye । hsphrẽ śrībhogapuranaṃdanāthaśrī bhogaprabhā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । vāyupaścimottare । hsphrẽ śrībimbadevanātha
śrībimbaprabhā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।
hsphrẽ śrīkhaḍgadevanātha śrīkhaḍgaprabhā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । (hsphẽ) śrīrudradevanāthaśrīrudraprabhā avvā saha pādu(kāṃ) pūjayāmi ।
(hsphrẽ) śrī(dhariṇide)vanātha śrīdevaprabhā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । hsphrẽ śrīmudra - - ṭanāthaśrīmadhuraprabhā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।
(17a)
hsphrẽ śrīvaṃkāpuradevaśrīvaraprabhā avvā –  - pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । hsphrẽ śrībhojadevanāthaśrībhojaprabhā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi ।
anena krame - pūrvvoktena tato madhye samayā devī pūjayet । dvātṛṃśadakṣarā paṃcapraṇavayuktyā (pūja)yet । tato hetukādyāṃ pūrvvādārabhyo
aiśānāntaṃ yāvatpūjayet । hskhphrẽ hetukāya hrīṃ śrīheraṃbā avvā saha pādukā pūjayāmi । pūrvve । hskhphrẽ śrītṛpurāntakāya hrī̃ tṛtra avvā
(17b)
saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । āgneye । hasakhaphrẽ śrīagnibetālāya hrīṃ agniśikhā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । yāmye ।
hasakhaphrẽ agnijihvāya hrī̃ anaṃtaprabhā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । naiṛtye । hskhphrẽ śrīkālākhyāya hrīṃ kālasaṃkarṣaṇī avvā saha
pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । vāruṇe ।।
hskhphreṃ śrīkāpālināya hrīṃ śrīkumudā avvā saha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । vāyavye ।। hskhphrẽ śrī ekapādāya hrīṃ śrīekalavīra avvā
(sa)ha pādukāṃ pūjayāmi । kubere ।
(18a)
hasakhaphrẽ śrībhīmarūpāya hrīṃ śrībhīmabhadrā avvā saha pā(dukāṃ) (pūjayāmi) । - - - - - - - - (saparivāraṃ) gurumaṇḍalaṃ pūjayet ।
tataḥ samayavidyāṃ (pūjayet) । - (ravatyātadravya) madhyamaṇḍalapūraṇārthe pūjayet । etadgurumaṇḍalaṃ paripūrṇṇa । aĩ - - (sana - rudāvajra)
padmāmāsana sthitāṃ ।

ṣaṭprakāra gatāṃ devīṃ taṃ vṛṃde parameśvarīṃ ।
- - - (snāna kane) - - - - nī yena śoṣitā ।।

