aĩ kṣlū̃ kṣa kṣmlū̃ sthānakṣetrapālapiṃgala bhrūbhaṃṅgalocanadaṃṣṭākarāla atyugraghorarūpabhayānaka phāṃ phīṃ phauṃ phaṭ ।
kṣaḥ kṣīṃ kṣāṃ mahākṣetrādhipataye alibalipiśitaṃ gṛhna gṛhna svāhā ।

।। iti sthānakṣetrapālasya baliḥ ।।

anantaraṃ mahāsamayomuccārya dvānamatyādevīṃ bṛhatsamayā samayaṃ pūrayet । puṣpāṃjaliṃ datvā namaskāraṃ kārayet । mudrātṛtayaṃ baṃdhayet ।।
