apaṭhanīya

(41a)
ṇaśobhitāṃ
tasyā rūpamajanaṃtaṃ devānāmapi durllabhaṃ ।
anaṃtaṃ pādayostasya nūpurā yatra maṇḍitaṃ ।।

takṣakakaṭideśe tu mekhalā yatra rājitaṃ ।
kārkoṭaṃ kaṃkaṇe yojya kaṇṭhe vāsuki saṃsthitaṃ ।।

mukuṭe kulikaṃ kṛtvā gonāsā karṇṇakuṇḍale ।
keyūramudrikāyāstu anye nāgakulāśca ye ।।

dakṣadaṇḍe sthitaṃ padmaṃ mahāpadmaṃ tu vāmake ।
khaṭvāṃgaṃ pāśamabhayaṃ akṣasūtraṃ tu pustakaṃ ।।

kaṭṭārakaṃ kare tasyāṃ saṃkhapālaṃ tathopari ।
kapālaṃ varadaṃ khaḍgaṃ triśūlāṃkuśadarpaṇaṃ ।।

dakṣiṇe tu kare devyā amarī dravyapaṃcakaṃ ।
(41b)
pūritaṃ ca mahādyaṃ malāciṃttāmaṇiryutaṃ ।।

dhyāyate śatataṃ bhaktyā ṣaṭpratāsanamuttamaṃ ।
brahmā viṣṇuśca rudraśca īśvaraśca sadāśiva ।।

bhairavaṃ tu mahāghoraṃ pretatvaṃ āsane sthitaṃ ।
idṛśaṃ tu mahādevī bhāvaye navayauvanām ।।

etaccakropamā devyā ārūḍhā kulaśāsane ।।
prasphuretkalikāle tu paścimāmnāyamuttamaṃ ।।

evaṃ rūpaṃ sa(dā jñā)tvā muktosau mocayedbahūn ।
tataḥ kṣamāpayetsarvaṃ sūtraṃtrayamudīrayet ।।

mālinī pīṭhakāścaiva mahāmāyāsamanvitā ।
(42a)
tato kṣamāpayetsarvvaṃ carucāraṃ samācaret ।।

aliphalgusamāyuktaṃ prāśayetaṃ kramāgrataḥ ।।
nirvisaṃketabhāvena yathā bhedo na jāyate ।।

jyeṣṭhānukramayogena saṃcaraṃti parasparaṃ ।।
tato kṣamāpayetpūjāṃ visarjanaṃ samārabhet ।।

aĩkārāsanamārūḍhāṃ vajrapadmoparisthitaṃ ।।
ṣaṭprakāragatāṃ devīṃ śrīkubjikākhyānnamāmyahaṃ ।।

yoginīpīṭhamārūḍhaṃ śrīkramapratipādinīṃ ।
nityānandakarī mātā śrīkubjikākhyānnamāmyahaṃ ।।

svabhāvaviśvarūpaṃ tu ājñāvijñānasambhavaṃ ।
(42b)
ṣaṭvidhaṃ cārasaṃcāraṃ śrīkubjikākhyāṃ namāmyahaṃ ।।

kaṃdotthā vahnirūpā tu sūryarūpā tu hṛdgatā ।
tālvotthā somarūpā tu tṛdhā ekatra saṃsthitā ।।

tṛdhāmadhamanī devī tṛtrikātṛkapūriṇī ।
yā kāścidyoginī raudrā saumyā ghoravatī tathā ।।

khecarī bhūcarī dhātrī prītā bhavatu me sadā ।।
karmmaṇā manasā vācā yatkiṃcitprakaromyahaṃ ।।

sā śakti preryato yasmāttasmātsarvaṃ kṣamasva māṃ ।
(mātṛ)sthāne vane ghore ciṃciṇī yena śoṣitā ।।

punaḥ saṃjīvitā yena tasmai śrīguruve namaḥ ।।
mahālakṣmī vane ghore bilvavṛkṣavidāritaṃ ।।
(43a)
trailokyacakravat khyāti tasya pādaṃ namāmyahaṃ ।।

akathyamaśrutaṃ tatvaṃ vākpathātītagocaraṃ ।
tatpadandarśitaṃ yena tasmai śrīguruve namaḥ ।।

saptasāgaraparyantaṃ saptadvīpasamanvitaṃ ।
akhaṇḍamaṇḍalākāraṃ maṅgalaṃ taṃ namāmyahaṃ ।।

hrī̃ rhsphrī̃ hrī̃ phrẽ ryrũ
gaccha gaccha parasthānaṃ yatra yatra niraṃjanaḥ ।
gacchaṃtu devatāḥ sarve svasthānaṃ sthānaṃmāśrayet ।।

hrīṃ rhrīṃ rhrīṃ phaṭ svāhā ।।

naṃdaṃtu sādhakakulā aṇimādi siddhā ।
sāpāpataṃtu samaṃ yadviṣayoginīnāṃ ।।

(44a)
sā sāṃbhavī haratu kāpi sa ādi siddhāṃ ।
yasyāṃ guruścaraṇa paṃkajameva la(bdhaṃ) ।। ।।

